    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character, buy and decorate houses, sell goods to merchants, build a life of peace and comfort. Explore new towns, stroll through idyllic meadows, farm fruits and veggies, cook and feast, forage for herbs, and then enjoy them in your pipe.\u00a0  Halfling promises a unique and immersive fantasy experience. Are you a peaceful Home-Dweller, content to enjoy the comforts of the home with your pipe weed and meals? Are you a hard farming Green-Thumb, gardening, farming, foraging, talking to trees and befriending nature?  or are you perhaps A Path-Finder, with a wild yearning for adventure and wanderlust in your heart, sleeping wild under the stars, cooking by the streams and searching for the elves? Farming is a process but it's an enjoyable one, especially when the reward is a good meal.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character, buy and decorate houses, sell goods to merchants, build a life of peace and comfort. Explore new towns, stroll through idyllic meadows, farm fruits and veggies, cook and feast, forage for herbs, and then enjoy them in your pipe.\u00a0  Halfling promises a unique and immersive fantasy experience. Are you a peaceful Home-Dweller, content to enjoy the comforts of the home with your pipe weed and meals? Are you a hard farming Green-Thumb, gardening, farming, foraging, talking to trees and befriending nature?  or are you perhaps A Path-Finder, with a wild yearning for adventure and wanderlust in your heart, sleeping wild under the stars, cooking by the streams and searching for the elves? Farming is a process but it's an enjoyable one, especially when the reward is a good meal.</p>",
    "short_description": "Make your Halfling, farm epic plants, explore a fantasy world, socialize in town, and then unwind with your pipe weed after a day of questing and foraging. Halfling is an open world, first person, cozy rpg.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
